# Parallax — environment template (committed)
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored and stays on your machine.

# Anthropic API key for the agent pipeline runner (scripts/pipeline.ts).
# Get one from: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Format: sk-ant-api03-...
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-replace-me

